{"product_id":"the-battle-for-barrels","title":"The Battle for Barrels","description":"\u003cp\u003eIt is widely accepted that global discoveries of conventional oil have peaked and that the era of cheap oil has gone forever. This book demonstrates that the doom and gloom of the \"peak oil\" theory is mistaken. Clarke rebuts the arguments of peak oil's adherents and discusses the issues they ignore—rising crude oil prices, new or future technologies, the potential to improve exploration acreage, changes in government policies, new corporate strategies, development in unconventional oils, and more.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Duncan Clarke\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781846680120\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 220\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Bookhero.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41757958570137,"sku":"6RF9781846680120","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-battle-for-barrels-466899.jpg?v=1694791682","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-battle-for-barrels","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}